## 💼 Experience

### 💰 Financial Management System — Full Stack Developer
**Freelance / Independent Project · 2026–Present**

Web application developed to help users manage and organize their
personal finances, allowing them to register, track and manage
financial transactions in one place.

- **Full Stack Development** — development of the application from the frontend to the backend, connecting the different layers of the system.
- **Frontend** — development of the user interface using React, focusing on reusable components, usability and responsive design.
- **Backend & APIs** — development and integration of APIs responsible for application operations and data management.
- **Authentication** — implementation of user authentication and access control.
- **Database Integration** — data persistence and integration between the application and the database.
- **Financial Management** — transaction management including description, amount, type and date.
- **Problem Solving** — analysis and resolution of technical problems encountered during development.
- **Continuous Development** — implementation of improvements, bug fixes and new features throughout the project.

**Technologies:** React · JavaScript · Node.js · APIs · Database

---

### 🤖 AI Agents & Intelligent Solutions — Full Stack Developer
**Freelance / Independent Projects · 2026–Present**

Development of applications and AI-powered solutions focused on
automation, information processing and practical problem solving.

- **AI Agents** — development of specialized agents designed to perform tasks and interact with user-provided information.
- **LLM Integration** — integration of Large Language Models into web applications.
- **Backend Integration** — communication between AI agents, APIs and application services.
- **Prompt Engineering** — design and optimization of prompts according to each agent's purpose.
- **RAG Solutions** — experimentation with Retrieval-Augmented Generation to provide relevant context to AI models.
- **Automation** — development of intelligent workflows to automate repetitive tasks and processes.

**Technologies:** Python · JavaScript · Node.js · AI · LLM · RAG · APIs

